cf-class-choice-modification = Initial Modification
cf-class-choice-innovationarmor = Power Suit
cf-class-choice-innovationarmor-desc = +5 AC, Dex cap +1, check -2, -5 feet, Strength 3. Choose an armor modification too.
cf-class-choice-innovationarmorsubterfuge = Subterfuge Suit
cf-class-choice-innovationarmorsubterfuge-desc = +2 AC, Dex cap +4, check -1. Choose an armor modification too.
cf-class-choice-innovationconstruct = Construct
cf-class-choice-innovationconstruct-desc = A clockwork construct that follows and fights for you, and shares your Overdrive. Choose a construct modification too. Pick it on the Pet tab to name it.
cf-class-choice-innovationweapon = Weapon
cf-class-choice-innovationweapon-desc = A weapon of your own design. Choose a weapon modification, and with it the weapon it is built on.
cf-class-choice-modarmorharmonicoscillator = Armor: Harmonic Oscillator
cf-class-choice-modarmorharmonicoscillator-desc = Worn, resist force and sonic by 3 + half your level, 2 more in Overdrive.
cf-class-choice-modarmormetallicreactance = Armor: Metallic Reactance
cf-class-choice-modarmormetallicreactance-desc = Worn, resist acid and electricity by 3 + half your level, 2 more in Overdrive.
cf-class-choice-modarmorotherworldlyprotection = Armor: Otherworldly Protection
cf-class-choice-modarmorotherworldlyprotection-desc = Worn, resist void and spirit by 3 + half your level, 2 more in Overdrive.
cf-class-choice-modarmorphlogistonicregulator = Armor: Phlogistonic Regulator
cf-class-choice-modarmorphlogistonicregulator-desc = Worn, resist cold and fire by half your level, 2 more in Overdrive.
cf-class-choice-modarmorspeedboosters = Armor: Speed Boosters
cf-class-choice-modarmorspeedboosters-desc = +5 feet Speed worn, +10 in Overdrive.
cf-class-choice-modarmormuscularexoskeleton = Armor: Muscular Exoskeleton
cf-class-choice-modarmormuscularexoskeleton-desc = +1 to Athletics in Overdrive. For the power suit.
cf-class-choice-modarmorsubtledampeners = Armor: Subtle Dampeners
cf-class-choice-modarmorsubtledampeners-desc = +1 to Stealth in Overdrive. For the subterfuge suit.
cf-class-choice-modweaponmodularhead = Weapon: Modular Head
cf-class-choice-modweaponmodularhead-desc = Any weapon. Use it in hand to switch between bludgeoning, piercing and slashing.
cf-class-choice-modweaponentanglingform = Weapon: Entangling Form
cf-class-choice-modweaponentanglingform-desc = A melee weapon. Disarm, grapple and trip traits.
cf-class-choice-modweaponheftycomposition = Weapon: Hefty Composition
cf-class-choice-modweaponheftycomposition-desc = A melee weapon. Shove, razing and versatile bludgeoning. Razing: an object you hit takes twice your damage dice more.
cf-class-choice-modweaponhamperingspikes = Weapon: Hampering Spikes
cf-class-choice-modweaponhamperingspikes-desc = A melee weapon. Hampering, trip and versatile piercing. Hampering: a hit gives the target -10 feet to its Speeds for 6 seconds.
cf-class-choice-modweapondynamicweighting = Weapon: Dynamic Weighting
cf-class-choice-modweapondynamicweighting-desc = A one-handed melee weapon without agile. Two-hand with a die one size larger, and versatile bludgeoning.
cf-class-choice-modweaponpacificationtools = Weapon: Pacification Tools
cf-class-choice-modweaponsegmentedframe = Weapon: Segmented Frame
cf-class-choice-modweaponsegmentedframe-desc = Any weapon. Use it in hand to switch between bludgeoning, piercing and slashing, and it is concealable. Collapsing it to light Bulk: TBA
cf-class-choice-modweaponcomplexsimplicity = Weapon: Complex Simplicity
cf-class-choice-modweaponcomplexsimplicity-desc = A simple weapon. Its damage die is one size larger, and you pick two of versatile bludgeoning, piercing, slashing and razing.
cf-class-choice-modweaponrazorprongs = Weapon: Razor Prongs
cf-class-choice-modweaponrazorprongs-desc = A melee weapon. Tearing, trip and versatile slashing. Tearing: a creature you hit takes 1 persistent bleed damage.
cf-class-choice-modweaponbluntshot = Weapon: Blunt Shot
cf-class-choice-modweaponbluntshot-desc = A ranged weapon. Concussive, so its damage uses the weaker of the target's piercing and bludgeoning resistance. Ranged trip does nothing, because Trip is not an action.
cf-class-choice-modconstructacceleratedmobility = Construct: Accelerated Mobility
cf-class-choice-modconstructacceleratedmobility-desc = Your construct's Speed is 40 feet.
cf-class-choice-modconstructsensoryarray = Construct: Sensory Array
cf-class-choice-modconstructsensoryarray-desc = Your construct has darkvision. Its tremorsense: TBA
cf-class-choice-modconstructwondergears = Construct: Wonder Gears
cf-class-choice-modconstructwondergears-desc = Your construct is trained in Intimidation, Stealth and Survival.
cf-class-choice-modconstructamphibiousconstruction = Construct: Amphibious Construction
cf-class-choice-modconstructamphibiousconstruction-desc = A swim Speed of 25 feet. Water does not exist yet: TBA
cf-class-choice-modconstructincreasedsize = Construct: Increased Size
cf-class-choice-modconstructincreasedsize-desc = Your construct is Large. Size does not change a body here yet: TBA
cf-class-choice-modconstructmanualdexterity = Construct: Manual Dexterity
cf-class-choice-modconstructmanualdexterity-desc = Your construct has hands for manipulate actions. It already fetches: anything more is TBA
cf-class-choice-modconstructprojectilelauncher = Construct: Projectile Launcher
cf-class-choice-modconstructprojectilelauncher-desc = A ranged unarmed attack, 1d4 bludgeoning or piercing, propulsive, 30 feet. A companion's ranged attack: TBA
cf-class-choice-modweaponpacificationtools-desc = A melee weapon. Disarm, hampering and nonlethal. The rules let you choose nonlethal each attack: here it always is.

cf-class-choice-apparition-primary = Primary Apparition
cf-class-choice-apparition-second = Second Apparition
cf-class-choice-primarycrafter = Crafter in the Vault
cf-class-choice-primarycrafter-desc = Lore (Architecture and Engineering). Spells: Sigil. Not built: Mending, Knock, Ghostly Weapon: TBA. Its vessel spell is not built: TBA.
cf-class-choice-secondcrafter = Crafter in the Vault
cf-class-choice-secondcrafter-desc = Lore (Architecture and Engineering). Spells: Sigil. Not built: Mending, Knock, Ghostly Weapon: TBA.
cf-class-choice-primarycustodian = Custodian of Groves and Gardens
cf-class-choice-primarycustodian-desc = Lore (Farming and Herbalism). Spells: Tangle Vine. Not built: Protector Tree, Gentle Breeze, Safe Passage: TBA. Vessel spell: Garden of Healing.
cf-class-choice-secondcustodian = Custodian of Groves and Gardens
cf-class-choice-secondcustodian-desc = Lore (Farming and Herbalism). Spells: Tangle Vine. Not built: Protector Tree, Gentle Breeze, Safe Passage: TBA.
cf-class-choice-primaryecho = Echo of Lost Moments
cf-class-choice-primaryecho-desc = Lore (Fortune-Telling and Genealogy). Spells: Figment, Dispel Magic. Not built: Deja Vu, Curse of Lost Time: TBA. Vessel spell: Store Time.
cf-class-choice-secondecho = Echo of Lost Moments
cf-class-choice-secondecho-desc = Lore (Fortune-Telling and Genealogy). Spells: Figment, Dispel Magic. Not built: Deja Vu, Curse of Lost Time: TBA.
cf-class-choice-primaryimpostor = Impostor in Hidden Places
